  "sourceFile": "\"Cycle of Prayer 2025-2026.pdf\", provided directly by Josh via Google Drive (file id 1YKKXg5T-Ld-hkPPzhFdIFwAp9CgtRAFG, folder \"TEC Cycle of Prayer\")",
